      └─ ssh  [KEEP] alias 'grove-sandpine-v20260901' matches the registry (camper@grove-sandpine-v20260901:22)

🌳 grove's awake!
   ├─ box:    i-0sandpine0000001 (exid=grove-sandpine-v20260901, account 000000000000)
